# Flip review: every flip from the front quarter (the rider's toe side, the camera ahead), from the flick
# to the landing, and from the tail end for the roll. Kickflips show the board's bottom first from the
# front (the heel-side edge dips first), heelflips the grip; a backside shove-it swings the tail behind
# the rider; the hardflip stands up between the spread legs; the Bigspin from a world-fixed camera.
#   ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/flips.strips --height 200
